WEBVTT

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.860
<i>Look at the time...</i>

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.620
<i>It's rough having work after club stuff.</i>

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.370
Listen, you can follow me all you want,

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.070
but I don't have anything to give you.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:33.290
#04
You Can't Play Tag by Yourself, 
and It's Fun to Play With Others

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.120
<i>An oni child.</i>

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:39.590
<i>When he grows up...</i>

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.360
I told you not to follow me.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.360
I have no interest in your kind.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:03.240
Go to Kashiwagi's place if you're cold.

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:05.190
The house with the red roof.

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:06.370
Understand?

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:09.940
The people who live there 
are kind, even to oni.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:14.690
Ask the gentleman there, 
and he'll give you something to eat.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:16.140
Go there.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:17.130
Got it?

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.480
Good boy.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.220
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:30.230
<i>I'll apologize to Kashiwagi later.</i>

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:36.920
I'm home.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.730
You're late!

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.810
Do you know what time it is?

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:42.000
Welcome home.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.110
I had work today.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.570
Were you waiting for me again?

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:47.810
N-Not really.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.040
It's not like I was worried 
about you or anything.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.000
Fine, fine.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.350
It's cold. Go to the living room.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:54.540
You, too, Onii-chan.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.380
You'd better go take a bath and warm up.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.100
Yeah.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.800
What's wrong, Onii-chan?

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:13.540
<i>He beat me home.</i>

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:21.250
I told you to go to Kashiwagi's place.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.750
Why are you here?

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.590
You can keep staring, 
but I'm not letting you in.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:26.770
Go elsewhere.

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:33.530
Onii-chan, can you teach me something?

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:35.920
I need help with my homework.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.770
What do you need help with?

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.420
Math.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.780
It's easy once you learn the formula.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:44.800
Try it.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:45.530
Okay.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.790
Only for tonight, got it?

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:09.380
Here.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:10.190
Tissues.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:16.840
<i>What do child oni eat?</i>

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.830
<i>Do they eat the same things as humans?</i>

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:21.970
<i>Beans... might not be a good idea.</i>

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.830
Come on, no one said you could use my bed.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:33.370
I don't mind you getting in 
bed, but not immediately.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.350
You need to take a bath first.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.720
You're all dirty.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:53.680
I've never seen an oni as dumb as you.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.250
You nearly got yourself burned.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:08.130
Hey, I'll squish you if you 
sleep too close. Stay away.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.610
Oh, well.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.700
It's just one night.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:26.160
Don't come back.

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:34.060
It's lunch time, Mii-kun.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.800
Sora-chan.

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.050
Motegi-san.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.110
You can have this.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:44.380
I baked you cookies in return 
for the stuffed toy you made me.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.640
Wow, thanks.

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.630
Is it a snowman?

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.010
Nope.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.770
It's a mummy.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.230
Sorry.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.390
Later.

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.680
Tazuki, let's go get lunch.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.270
Y-Yeah.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:05.820
Hey, want to see that crazy 
photo I was talking about?

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.030
I don't really care, but...

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:09.930
Don't you want to see it?

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.080
Here, I'll show you.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.190
Ta-da.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:16.030
I saw this weird creature in my back yard.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:19.410
Huh... You're good at Photoshopping.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.140
No, it's real!

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.540
Oh, come on.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.880
Huh, an oni child followed you home?

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:27.920
Yeah.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.780
I told him to go to your place, 
but he followed me home.

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:33.620
It's such a nuisance.

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:36.890
Why would you just go ahead 
and introduce me to him?

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:41.140
He must have been kicked out 
at the last Setsubun festival.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.410
Why don't you let him stay?

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:46.330
Don't be crazy. Are you serious?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.270
Why are you so against it?

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:50.300
Do you hate oni?

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:56.280
And I hate that derpy face.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.850
Really?

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:02.320
That derpy face lets him 
get away with anything.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:06.290
He's been giving me nothing but a headache.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.370
<i>Oh. So he does love him.</i>

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.540
Okay, you should just keep him.

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:17.640
Dude, you interpreted what I just said 
in a <i>really</i> positive light, didn't you?

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.090
I let him loose in the yard this morning.

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:24.340
He should be gone by now.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.400
I see.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:29.640
Oh, yeah, want some cookies?

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.240
Motegi-san baked them for me.

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:35.160
Snowmen?

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:36.700
Mii-kun.

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:38.370
Wow.

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:40.430
Time to eat.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.720
One more night, and that's it. All right?

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.430
Who said you could eat that?

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:04.720
Later.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.860
Onii-chan, have you seen my snacks?

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:20.780
They've been vanishing lately.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:22.510
An oni child?!

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:25.040
Sorry, he helped himself to it.

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:27.920
Well, all right.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.250
Hey, Onii-chan?

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:38.000
Yeah?

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.880
That oni child's been here for a while now.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.560
Aren't you going to give him a name?

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:45.930
You're keeping him, aren't you?

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.190
It'd be cruel not to.

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:50.040
<i>Wait, is this...</i>

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.990
So you decided to keep him, huh?

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.320
No, he's just made himself 
a home at my place.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.820
Is he always at home?

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:03.030
He's out during the day, 
but he comes back at night.

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:07.390
He totally thinks it's his home now.

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:09.250
It's not funny.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.960
You should bring him over sometime.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.860
He can play with Mii-kun.

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:18.220
Hey, Mii-kun, you have to stay inside.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.700
Stop, I'm trying to study.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:29.640
Damn it, you have such a derpy face.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:34.090
<i>It's been a week since he came here.</i>

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:37.280
<i>The Setsubun festival was two weeks ago.</i>

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:41.340
He must have been kicked out 
at the last Setsubun festival.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.530
<i>That's what Kashiwagi said...</i>

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:47.020
<i>But would he really get that dirty in a week?</i>

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:50.850
<i>And all the scars on his body...</i>

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:53.840
<i>Nothing but bad memories come to mind.</i>

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:03.050
<i>It was in preschool that I first 
learned of their existence.</i>

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:07.250
<i>Kashiwagi was always by 
himself, so I said hi.</i>

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.630
<i>And there was something at his feet.</i>

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:22.880
<i>The more I hung out with Kashiwagi, 
the more I learned about that creature.</i>

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:28.600
<i>At first, I'd only encountered 
them when I was with Kashiwagi.</i>

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:31.960
They spread by word-of-mouth.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.470
Word-of-mouth?

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.900
You know how those kids 
stay hidden from humans?

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:41.970
They share information about 
the humans that they know,

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:47.100
and they show up to just those 
humans when they need help.

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.100
That's what Dad told me.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:55.860
<i>That must be why I started seeing 
those creatures more often,</i>

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.420
<i>even when I wasn't around Kashiwagi.</i>

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:05.740
A dragon.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:07.420
It's hurt.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.120
I have to tend its wounds.

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:11.090
<i>Come to think of it now,</i>

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:15.750
<i>I should have known more about 
those creatures' circumstances.</i>

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:24.910
Listen, I haven't approved 
of you living here.

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:28.490
If you need someone's help, 
go see a professional.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.980
You're an oni.

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.790
You understand what I'm saying, don't you?

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:39.380
What about my scar?

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.280
Are you telling me we have the same scar?

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.160
Good for you.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:13:00.150
<i>This kid really doesn't 
understand what I'm saying.</i>

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:04.380
Drink some tea.

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:08.860
What a needy oni child.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.020
I'm home.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.340
What's wrong?

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.040
You're in a bad mood.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.260
Do you like that stuffed toy?

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.250
You can keep it, but don't get it dirty.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.970
<i>I thought he wanted it, no?</i>

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:50.050
<i>I really can't get a read on his behavior.</i>

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:57.490
Anyway, that's what happened.

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:58.520
Huh...

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:01.280
I wonder if he wanted you to 
play with the doll with him.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:02.360
I don't know.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:05.760
I thought he might lonely 
being by himself, but...

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:07.630
He's not moving.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.660
He isn't.

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:14.600
I bet he's thinking really hard about 
who that is standing in front of him.

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:19.090
I guarantee you he isn't 
thinking about anything.

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.260
Oh...

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:38.870
Hey, don't break anything running around.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.510
Don't get hurt.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.750
Are they playing tag?

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.830
Looks like they're friends now.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:03.590
Yeah.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.870
He gets pretty calm when he's with Mii.

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:17.990
Oh, yeah, Tazuki, what are 
you going to name him?

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:19.000
His name?

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.810
Yeah. Aren't you giving him one?

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.820
I don't need to give him a...

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:30.220
I think it'll be easier to get his attention.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:33.420
I guess.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.580
All right.

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:37.820
I might as well make it 
an easy name to remember.

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:39.330
Yeah, I agree.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:43.090
In which case, it should 
probably be a familiar name.

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:45.650
Yeah, I think so.

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:49.490
And it'll probably be easy to say 
if it's around three syllables.

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:51.090
Yeah, sounds good.

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:55.110
Okay, "Tanaka."

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:56.100
Say what?!

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.160
Tazuki, think carefully.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.500
Tanaka is a last name.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.100
There's one in our class!

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.740
How about Satou, then?

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:05.230
That's still a last name! 
That's not the point!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.170
All right, Ichirou, Jirou, Saburou, Shirou...

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:11.240
Don't you dare say Gorou.

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:14.370
What?

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.030
How about Conny, then?

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:25.500
Like ko-oni, but Conny.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.300
"Oni child"

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.300
"Kooni"

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.300
"Ko-ni"

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.300
"Koni-"

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.510
"Conny!"

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.140
Conny, huh? Yeah.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:45.460
That's a good name.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.240
You must be hungry.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.020
Let's have lunch.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:55.530
Hand-rolled sushi?

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:56.370
Yeah.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.250
I want to become friends with Conny.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.730
Let's make sushi together 
to get to know each other.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:07.320
Nah, I don't really care to get to know him.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:13.450
This, this, and this are the 
kinds of things we can make.

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:14.770
Doesn't it look fun?

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:18.760
It's pretty different from the 
hand-rolled sushi that I know.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.520
That's practically art.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.260
It's hard to know how firmly to press, huh?

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:31.280
Want to roll it together?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:36.430
<i>Why does he listen to Kashiwagi so well?</i>

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:39.460
<i>I need to help Mii.</i>

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:40.780
<i>He's probably having a hard time.</i>

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.740
<i>He's good at it!</i>

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:47.340
I had him help a few times.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:49.110
I see. No wonder.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:51.720
It's hard at first, though.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:52.620
Can you do it?

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:53.290
Yeah.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.670
Should I just roll it like this?

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.130
Yeah.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.630
Hold it here, and like this.

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:08.070
Ah, you did it.

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:10.940
Hey, that's pretty goo—

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:14.530
What do you think you're doing?

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.200
Who told you to...

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:20.060
He must have given you the best one.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.630
Well, thanks.

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:27.150
<i>You should just tell him he did a good job.</i>

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.830
<i>He just can't be honest.</i>

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.010
Ta-da.

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:33.840
This is our present to you.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:37.310
Tazuki made Conny, and I made Mii-kun.

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:41.090
There, there.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:43.220
I thought you'd cry, Mii-kun.

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:49.900
Good for you.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:57.950
I got it.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.110
Calm down and eat.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.800
<i>What the hell am I doing?</i>

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:04.750
<i>I'm actually socializing with him.</i>

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:14.680
<i>Well, just for today, I guess.</i>

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.670
Don't forget to drink your tea.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:21.760
And there's rice on your face.

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.660
Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.430
Yeah.

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:29.840
Oh, yeah, Kashiwagi...

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:32.870
Here.

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:34.570
What's this? A letter?

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:38.530
"What to feed the oni child"...

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:40.200
"What not to feed him"...

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.570
I thought you might know.

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:47.710
<i>He says he hates him, but he's 
totally set on keeping him.</i>

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.830
Stop making that face.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:54.080
Just so you know, I'm just 
asking for reference.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.760
In case something happens.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:57.450
Okay, okay.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.800
Well, if anything happens, I'm here for you.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:02.790
Don't bottle it up too much.

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.470
You tend to worry too much.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:09.090
Let's see, oni children are omnivorous.

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:10.480
They'll eat anything.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.310
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.760
Onii-chan, the bath's ready.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:19.740
Okay.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.350
Yo, it's time for a bath.

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:31.000
<i>After he threw him away yesterday?</i>

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:35.150
<i>Now that they're friends, he misses him.</i>

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.610
<i>He can be kind of cute, huh?</i>

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:45.150
<i>Nothing will change if I kick him out.</i>

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:49.970
<i>I never managed to save that dragon.</i>

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:05.950
<i>I'm just trying to run away, 
saying he doesn't need a name</i>

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:09.490
<i>or that he's just invited himself in.</i>

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.640
<i>I'm just scared that when 
something happens to him,</i>

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:15.860
<i>I'm going to be responsible.</i>

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:24.150
Are you awake?

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.380
Hey, let's go for a bath.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.110
Hey!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.490
Wake up!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:32.760
I know you're awake.

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:35.270
You weren't snoring like that before.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:37.210
Hey!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:41.280
<i>No...</i>

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:49.780
Get up, Conny.

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:55.810
You're such a pain.

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:04.560
Violent.

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:07.530
Thick-nerved.

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:09.120
Not at all endearing.

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:10.550
Selfish.

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:16.700
You certainly aren't cute.

00:23:50.850 --> 00:23:55.110
Mii-kun learned to pack his own lunch.

00:23:55.110 --> 00:23:59.790
I know you're stealing 
bites, though, Mii-kun.

00:23:59.660 --> 00:24:04.630
Next episode
Go Away Kindness, Go Away Fear

00:24:00.420 --> 00:24:01.690
<i>How to Keep a Mummy</i>!

00:24:01.690 --> 00:24:03.320
See you next episode.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:07.920
<b>See you next time!</b>
